# Graph retrieval + shared memory

Every new session: read `.agents/memory/GOAL.md` (final goal). Then `.agents/memory/WORKSPACE.md` before status / “where does X live” / RAG questions.

```
enhance → retrieve (WORKSPACE.md ∥ graph_retrieve.py ∥ grep) → verify file:line → persist verified only
```

```bash
python3 .agents/skills/graph-retrieval-memory/scripts/graph_retrieve.py -q "<topic>" --hops 2
```

Cursor CLI `sessionStart` injects a bounded GOAL + latest WORKSPACE excerpt. Excerpt is not status.

Then open the returned paths. `architecture-graph.json` is not status (`generatedAt` is null). Code wins.

Persist verified bullets to `.agents/memory/WORKSPACE.md` only.

